###Get Class Profile [GET /school/students/{?id,name}]
Getting Resource Related to registered class for a class profile.
+ Parameters
    + id:`hgf87-6890-iojds87-fv9i0v-0f897vf90-djlvf09e8` (required,number) ~ID given to Class during classes registration which required for class profile.
    + name:"S6PCB" (required, string) ~ class name which is used as url params.

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        [
            {   This data can be displayed as class header.
                 id: "hgf87-6890-iojds87-fv9i0v-0f897vf90-djlvf09e8",
                name: "S6PCB",
                profile: "profile",
                subject: "Kiny 2019",
                updatedDate: "Sep 20",
                teacherName: "Muhoza tony",
                code: "@6678"
            }
        ]

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        [
            List of class students which are assigned for the selected class
            {
              name: "Muhozi Alex",
              gender: "Male",
              date: "19 year old"
            },
            {
              name: "Shema Fred",
              gender: "Female",
              date: "18 year old"
            },
            {
              name: "Mucyo Allan",
              gender: "Male",
              date: "11 year old"
            }
        ]

###Create Class [POST /school/classes]
Setting Resource related to class during classes registiration.

+ Request (application/json)

    + Attributes
        + name:"S6PCB"(required)
        + code:"@568"(required)
        + profile:"S6PCB.png"(required)
        
+ Response 201 (application/json)

        Location: /admin/schools 

            [
                {
                    message: "success",
                    status: "class created succefully"
                }
            ]

+ Response 400 (application/json)

        [
            {
                message: "validation error",
                error: {
                    name: "name is required"||
                    code: "country is required"||
                    profile: "phoneNumber is required"||
                }
            }
        ];

+ Response 503 (application/json)

        [
            {
                message: "class could not be created",
                error: "Delivery Failure"
            }
        ]

