### Get Bus Company Profile [GET /company-profile/{?id,name}]
Resource related in reading a company profile for school.

+ Parameters
       + id: `hgf87-6890-iojds87fv9i0v-0f897vf90-djlvf09e8`(required,string) ~ ID of company related to company id given during registration.
       + name: "Matunda LTD"(required,string)~ Name of company related to company name given during registration.

+ Response 200 (application/json)

                {
                   id: "002"(required,string) ~ ID of company related to company id given during registration.
                   name: "Matunda LTD"(required,string)~ Name of company related to company name given during registration.
                   status:"partened"(required,string) ~ Status related company availablity if is neither partened nor Requested then school can make it partner. 
                   buses:"452"(required,number) ~ buses related to total number of buses owened by company.
                   drivers:"100"(required,number) ~ Drivers related to total number of drivers owened by company as employee.
                   connectionCovered:"2000"(required,number) ~ Connection covered by company as work covered by company.
                   Experienced:"5"(required,number) ~ Experienced time of company.
                }

###Make Partner [POST /companies/{?id}]
Sending Resource related to make company as partner.


+ Parameters

    + id:"003",

+ Request (application/json)

    + Attributes
        + select:"i agree with term and condition"(required) ~ if you need to confrim in order to make partnership.
        
+ Response 201 (application/json)

        Location: /companies 

            [
                {
                    message: "success",
                    status: "make partner succefully"
                }
            ]

+ Response 400 (application/json)

        [
            {
                message: "validation error",
                error: {
                    select: "select is required"||
                }
            }
        ];

+ Response 503 (application/json)

        [
            {
                message: "make partner doesn't done",
                error: "Delivery Failure"
            }
        ]

